      "published_at": "2024-04-12",
      "source": "wotc",
      "comment": "Plot abilities are written “Plot [cost],” which means “Any time you have priority during your main phase while the stack is empty, you may pay [cost] and exile this card from your hand. It becomes plotted.”"
